   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "1 \u00b7 Description"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Every report in this suite has a three-dot menu for downloading it. On Sales By Customer and Sales By Representative the four options in that menu read:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Download Summary (PDF)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Download Expanded View (PDF)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Download Summary (CSV)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Download Expanded View (CSV)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "On "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Technician Utilization",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " the same four options read:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Summary (PDF)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Summary (CSV)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Expanded (PDF)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Expanded (CSV)",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "strong"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "The word "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Download",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " is missing from the front of all four, and "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expanded View",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " has become "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Expanded",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": ". Technician Utilization is the odd one out rather than the whole suite being different."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Why it matters:",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " it is the same menu, doing the same thing, worded two different ways in one product. The product owner's answer when shown this was simply: "
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "\"B) is correct here. Consistency is key.\"",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " \u2014 meaning bring this report into line with the others."
      }
     ]
    },
