       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "The three-dot menu IS leftmost in the action cluster, followed by Column Selection, then the date-range picker, the technician filter and the location filter \u2014 matching the spec exactly. But the menu holds FOUR items, not three: \"Summary (PDF)\", \"Summary (CSV)\", \"Expanded (PDF)\", \"Expanded (CSV)\" \u2014 no \"Download\" prefix anywhere, and a second CSV variant the spec does not describe."
