        {
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": " two other findings on the same report's downloads were recorded on the same day \u2014 the Summary PDF omits its Summary row, and the PDF file names are lower-case where the description gives them in Title Case. They are not part of this ticket and have not been raised separately; mentioned only because the same code is likely involved."
